tarting:"Refreshing channel connection...",completed:"Bot created. Updating channel state...",failed:"Creation failed. Please try again."},feishuHelpModes:{create:{summary:"Scan to create a new Feishu bot, then the app writes the generated credentials back automatically."},manual:{summary:"Use this when you already have an App ID and App Secret and only need to link the existing bot."}},feishuHelpExisting:{summary:"This page maintains the current bot configuration only. To create a different Feishu bot, return to the channel list and add a new account."},qqbotModeBadge:"Create via QR / Manual",createQQBotBot:"Create QQ Bot",qqbotCreateDescription:"Create a new QQ Bot through the official QR flow and write the generated credentials back to the app automatically.",qqbotCreateInstructions:['Choose "Create QQ Bot" and generate a QR code below',"Scan the QR code in QQ and complete the official bot binding flow","After binding succeeds, the app will save the generated App ID / Client Secret and refresh the channel state",'If you already have an App ID / Client Secret, switch back to "Link Existing Bot"'],qqbotModes:{create:{title:"Create QQ Bot",description:"Scan a QR code to create a new QQ Bot and connect it automatically."},manual:{title:"Link Existing Bot",description:"Enter an existing App ID / Client Secret and keep the current manual setup flow."}},qqbotCreateStates:{waiting_scan:"Scan with QQ to bind the bot",creating_bot:"Scanned. Binding the bot...",completed:"Bot bound. Updating channel state...",failed:"Binding failed. Please try again."},qqbotHelpModes:{create:{summary:"Scan to create/bind a new QQ Bot, then the app writes the generated credentials back automatically."},manual:{summary:"Use this when you already have an App ID and Client Secret and only need to link the existing bot."}}},meta:{feishu:{description:"Connect Feishu/Lark bot via WebSocket",instructions:["Read the documentation, then go to Feishu Open Platform","Create a new application","Get App ID and App Secret","In Event Subscriptions, switch to Long Connection and subscribe to message receive and card interaction events","Save the config, finish bot setup, then publish the Feishu app version"]}}},videoWorkbench:{header:{badge:"Video Workbench",title:"AI Video Workbench",pageTitle:"AI Video Generation",generationQueue:"Generation Queue",newTask:"New Task",history:"History"},navigation:{label:"Quick Jump",currentDraft:"Current Draft",runningTask:"Running Task"},inspiration:{title:"Start your video creation and bring ideas to life",description:"Pick a preset prompt to get started, then refine it below with assets, aspect ratio, duration, and camera language.",presetLabel:"Preset Prompts",expand:"Show More Presets",collapse:"Collapse Presets",compactHint:"The latest task is now running above. Expand to quickly swap to another preset."},presetCards:{cyberpunkCity:{title:"Cyber Moto",subtitle:"Sci‑fi speed / chase cam",prompt:"8K ultra‑HD, 60fps cyberpunk motorcycle chase. A futuristic bike with sharp metal body, neon lighting, and blue‑purple light trails from spinning wheels; holographic dashboard flickers. The rider races through high‑tech grid streets where the road emits flowing light ripples, and headlights cut through the night. Camera stays close to the bike with high‑speed tracking; motion blur and particle exhaust amplify speed. Holographic ads and cold architecture compress the scene. Smooth camera, no jitter; reflections obey physics; no looping; subject and bike structure remain perfectly consistent; no deformation/clipping/watermark."},wuxiaAction:{title:"Wuxia Rain Duel",subtitle:"Narrative action / rain fight",prompt:"8K ultra‑HD, 60fps cinematic wuxia epic. In a rainy Jiangnan ancient street, puddles mirror warm lantern light. A black‑gold armored swordsman leaps from rooftop into a group of masked enemies; the blade cuts through rain with parries and strikes, then lands and spins to repel multiple foes in a continuous sequence. Splash, cloth, and debris follow strict physics. Camera pushes down from a high overhead into mid‑shots, circles into blade close‑ups, then fast push‑pull reveals the full brawl, ending with a slow pull‑back freeze on the sheath‑away silhouette. No loops; next‑gen PBR realism; volumetric rain and cold light; subject identity stays absolutely consistent; no deformation/clipping/watermark."},productShowcase:{title:"Commercial Product",subtitle:"Premium lighting / product film",prompt:"8K ultra‑HD, 60fps premium product commercial. Center frame: a sleek product with razor‑sharp, readable label on a high‑gloss dark stage. Subtle physically‑plausible micro vibration; light waves ripple across the reflective surface. Abstract energy beams weave in the background, building anticipation. Camera rushes from a side angle into macro close‑up to emphasize material clarity and strong silhouette, then smoothly pulls back to reveal full presence. Soft fill and hard key alternate precisely; rich, accurate colors with no color cast. Stable centered subject, natural light fluctuations; no loops, no watermark."},natureBreeze:{title:"Coastal Aerial",subtitle:"Nature vista / cinematic drone",prompt:"8K ultra‑HD, 60fps immersive aerial film. The camera dives from heavy clouds, skims over wildflowers on grassy slopes and dark cliff faces, then approaches a majestic Nordic coastline. A figure walks near the cliff edge; a flock of seagulls sweeps past the lens; waves slam the rocks; grass blades sway in wind. God‑rays pierce cloud gaps and shadows race across the terrain with dramatic contrast. Movement stays buttery‑smooth with no stutter. No loops, no distortion; true‑to‑life color; epic freedom atmosphere with coherent motion between nature and character."}},composer:{none:"None",promptPlaceholder:"Describe your idea. ",context:{title:"Current Context",agent:"Expand · {{agent}}",model:"Model · {{model}}",references_one:"{{count}} reference asset",references_other:"{{count}} reference assets",frames_o