3. Every shot must specify: shot size + camera movement + subject action.
4. ${i.outputLine}

## Output Format
Return strict JSON only, without markdown fences or extra commentary.
JSON shape: {"prompt":"string","summary":"string"}
- "prompt": ${i.promptDesc}
- "summary": a brief description of the expansion strategy (scene type, segment count, key camera techniques)

## Timing Structure (MANDATORY — based on ${e.durationSec} seconds)
